---
// Mintlify <CodeGroup> tabs sibling fenced code blocks by their `title` meta.
// Astro cannot read those titles from here — the children arrive already
// rendered — so this stacks them in a labelled container instead of silently
// dropping any. Every snippet stays visible and copyable, which is the part
// that matters; only the tabbing is lost.
---

<div class="ml-code-group"><slot /></div>
